    "About": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À propos"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关于"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Always copy as plain text": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toujours copier en texte brut"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "始终以纯文本复制"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An open-source clipboard manager for macOS.\nSync is off by default. Turn it on and your history goes only to your own iCloud or a folder you choose — never to a server of ours.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un gestionnaire de presse-papiers open source pour macOS.\nLa synchronisation est désactivée par défaut. Une fois activée, votre historique ne va que dans votre propre iCloud ou dans un dossier que vous choisissez — jamais sur un serveur qui nous appartient."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开源的 macOS 剪贴板管理工具。\n同步默认关闭。开启后，历史也只会进入你自己的 iCloud 或你选定的文件夹——不会经过我们的服务器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Any folder all of your devices share works — for example a folder inside iCloud Drive, or a company drive. Copyo keeps its files in its own subfolder and can only reach the folder you pick here.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "N’importe quel dossier partagé par tous vos appareils convient — par exemple un dossier dans iCloud Drive ou un disque d’entreprise. Copyo place ses fichiers dans son propre sous-dossier et n’a accès qu’au dossier que vous choisissez ici."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "任意多台设备都能共享的文件夹皆可，例如 iCloud Drive 里的某个文件夹或公司共享盘。Copyo 会把自己的文件放在其中的专属子文件夹里，且只能访问你在此选定的文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Anything you copy shows up here automatically": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tout ce que vous copiez apparaît ici automatiquement"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复制任何内容后会自动出现在这里"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Applies when you press Return. ⌥↩ always copies as plain text.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "S’applique lorsque vous appuyez sur Retour. ⌥↩ copie toujours en texte brut."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按回车时生效。⌥↩ 始终以纯文本复制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "By default your clipboard history and Pinboards sync between your Macs through iCloud Drive (iCloud Drive/Copyo/). The data only ever passes through your own iCloud — Copyo never touches a third-party server. Deletions are not propagated across devices.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Par défaut, votre historique du presse-papiers et vos Pinboards se synchronisent entre vos Mac via iCloud Drive (iCloud Drive/Copyo/). Les données ne passent que par votre propre iCloud : Copyo ne touche jamais à un serveur tiers. Les suppressions ne sont pas propagées entre les appareils."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认经由 iCloud Drive（iCloud Drive/Copyo/）在你的多台 Mac 之间同步剪贴板历史与 Pinboard。数据只经过你自己的 iCloud，Copyo 不接触任何第三方服务器。删除操作不跨设备传播。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancel": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Annuler"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "取消"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Changing the sync method takes effect after you restart Copyo.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le changement de méthode de synchronisation prend effet après le redémarrage de Copyo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更改同步方式后需要重启 Copyo 才会生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
