          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输入即可搜索"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unknown Source": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Source inconnue"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未知来源"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unlimited": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Illimité"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无限制"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unpin": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ne plus épingler"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "取消固定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Until Copyo restarts, this Mac keeps sending your clipboard history to your iCloud private database. Copyo is also still sending the entries you deleted; whatever has not been sent when Copyo restarts stays in iCloud.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tant que Copyo n’a pas redémarré, ce Mac continue d’envoyer votre historique du presse-papiers vers votre base de données privée iCloud. Copyo est aussi encore en train d’envoyer les éléments que vous avez supprimés ; ce qui n’aura pas été envoyé au moment du redémarrage restera dans iCloud."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Copyo 重启之前，这台 Mac 仍会把你的剪贴板历史发送到你的 iCloud 私有数据库。Copyo 同时还在发送你删掉的那些条目；重启时还没发出去的部分会留在 iCloud 里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Until Copyo restarts, this Mac keeps sending your clipboard history to your iCloud private database. If you don’t restart now, Copyo keeps using iCloud sync for the rest of this session.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tant que Copyo n’a pas redémarré, ce Mac continue d’envoyer votre historique du presse-papiers vers votre base de données privée iCloud. Si vous ne redémarrez pas maintenant, Copyo continuera d’utiliser la synchronisation iCloud pendant tout le reste de cette session."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Copyo 重启之前，这台 Mac 仍会把你的剪贴板历史发送到你的 iCloud 私有数据库。如果现在不重启，本次会话余下的时间里 Copyo 会继续使用 iCloud 同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Version %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "版本 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welcome to Copyo": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bienvenue dans Copyo"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "欢迎使用 Copyo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the limit is exceeded, the oldest unpinned entries are removed automatically. Anything pinned to a Pinboard is unaffected.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Au-delà de la limite, les éléments non épinglés les plus anciens sont supprimés automatiquement. Les éléments épinglés à un Pinboard ne sont pas concernés."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "超出上限时最旧的未固定记录会被自动清理，固定到 Pinboard 的内容不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your clipboard history and Pinboards sync between your Macs through the folder you chose. The data only ever passes through your own storage — Copyo never touches a third-party server. Deletions are not propagated across devices.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre historique du presse-papiers et vos Pinboards se synchronisent entre vos Mac via le dossier que vous avez choisi. Les données ne passent que par votre propre stockage : Copyo ne touche jamais à un serveur tiers. Les suppressions ne sont pas propagées entre les appareils."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "经由你选定的文件夹在你的多台 Mac 之间同步剪贴板历史与 Pinboard。数据只经过你自己的存储，Copyo 不接触任何第三方服务器。删除操作不跨设备传播。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your clipboard history stays on this Mac only.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre historique du presse-papiers reste uniquement sur ce Mac."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "剪贴板历史只保存在这台 Mac 上，不做任何同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud Account": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
